{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53997","headline":"十二时歌 二 · 从谂","name":"十二时歌 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平旦寅，荒村破院实难论。\n解斋粥米全无粒，空对闲窗与隙尘。\n唯雀噪，勿人亲，独坐时闻落叶频。\n谁道出家憎爱断，思量不觉泪沾巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"从谂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}